.SS "Contributing"
All validation functions are generated using doT templates in \fRdot\fP folder\&. Templates are precompiled so doT is not a run-time dependency\&.

.PP
\fRnpm run build\fP - compiles templates to \fRdotjs\fP folder\&.

.PP
\fRnpm run watch\fP - automatically compiles templates when files in dot folder change

